<https://w3id.org/sanskrit-lexicon/repwg/sense/entry/rah/dict/koch/1> a ontolex:LexicalSense ;
  skos:definition "रह् /rah/ (P. pr. /rahati/ — I- fut. /rahiṣyati/- pf. /rarāha/- aor. /arahīt/- pp. /rahita/) 1) разделять, отделять 2) разлучать"@ru ;
